0\" viewBox=\"0 0 92.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 33.8 33.8 40.6 40.6 40.6 48.8 61.6 61.6 68.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"48.8 68.3 76.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve biz onları tahvif ediyoruz<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"241\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 241.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 30.8 37.6 37.6 44.3 64.6 71.3 71.3 78.0 84.8 91.6 91.6 98.3 98.3 117.8 122.3 129.8 129.8 145.6 145.6 154.6 154.6 163.6 163.6 172.6 179.3 179.3 186.8 202.6 209.3 218.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"44.3 84.8 122.3 186.8 209.3 218.3 225.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> de o - tahvif - onlara başka bir şey artırmıyor ancak büyük bir tuğyan.</p><p>Neden mi?</p>","y":0}